{% block content %}{% raw %}
<section class="tour-hero">
        <h1>Sekumpul Waterfall Trek</h1>
        <p style="font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:10px;">Lush Jungles, Hidden Falls, and Northern Valleys</p>
    </section>

    <main class="tour-container">
        <div class="tour-grid">
            <div class="tour-description">
                <p style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:30px;color:#444;">Immerse yourself in the untamed beauty of Northern Bali. Renowned as the most spectacular waterfall on the island, Sekumpul consists of majestic twin cascades plunging 80 meters into a lush jungle ravine. Guided by a certified local village expert, you will hike through exotic fruit plantations, cross river streams, and discover hidden natural pools perfect for a refreshing swim.</p>
                
                <h2 class="section-heading">Tour Itinerary</h2>
                <ul class="itinerary-list">
                    <li class="itinerary-item">
                        <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid car"></i></div>
                        <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>07:00 AM – Hotel Pick-up</h3><p>Relax in our private A/C transport as we drive to the mountainous region of Northern Bali.</p></div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="itinerary-item">
                        <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid person-hiking"></i></div>
                        <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>09:30 AM – Sekumpul Jungle Trek</h3><p>Meet your local guide at the village and begin your descent through dense tropical foliage and spice farms.</p></div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="itinerary-item">
                        <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid water"></i></div>
                        <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>10:30 AM – Sekumpul & Fiji Waterfalls</h3><p>Stand in awe at the base of the twin falls. Feel the mist and swim in the natural rock pools.</p></div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="itinerary-item">
                        <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid utensils"></i></div>
                        <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>01:30 PM – Scenic Lunch</h3><p>A traditional Indonesian lunch at a local restaurant with views over the valley.</p></div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="itinerary-item">
                        <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid mountain"></i></div>
                        <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>03:00 PM – Twin Lakes Viewpoint</h3><p>Panoramic views over Lake Buyan and Lake Tamblingan in the Bedugul highlands.</p></div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="itinerary-item">
                        <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid car"></i></div>
                        <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>05:30 PM – Return to Hotel</h3><p>Private transfer back to your Bali hotel.</p></div>
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <div class="tour-gallery">
                    <h2>Tour Gallery</h2>
                    <div class="gallery-grid">
                        <div class="gallery-item"><img src="src/assets/sekumpul/trekking-sekumpul.webp" alt="Trekking through jungle to Sekumpul Waterfall North Bali" fetchpriority="high" width="300" height="225"></div>
                        <div class="gallery-item"><img src="src/assets/sekumpul/sekumpul-waterfall-trekking-path.webp" alt="Jungle trekking path leading to Sekumpul Waterfall" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                        <div class="gallery-item"><img src="src/assets/sekumpul/sekumpul-waterfall-trekking-route.webp" alt="Lush jungle trekking route to Sekumpul" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                        <div class="gallery-item"><img src="src/assets/sekumpul/sekumpul-rice-terrace.webp" alt="Rice terraces on the way to Sekumpul Waterfall North Bali" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                        <div class="gallery-item"><img src="src/assets/sekumpul/experience-nature-side.webp" alt="Fiji Waterfall hidden in Sekumpul jungle North Bali" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                        <div class="gallery-item"><img src="src/assets/sekumpul/sekumpul-waterfall-forest.webp" alt="Majestic Sekumpul Waterfall surrounded by dense forest" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                        <div class="gallery-item"><img src="src/assets/sekumpul/twin-lake-view.webp" alt="Twin Lakes Buyan and Tamblingan panoramic viewpoint Bali" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                        <div class="gallery-item"><img src="src/assets/sekumpul/twin-lake-view-north-bali.webp" alt="Aerial view of Twin Lakes in Bedugul highlands North Bali" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-section">
                    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">How difficult is the Sekumpul Waterfall trek? <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></button>
                    <div class="faq-answer"><p>The trek is moderately challenging — approximately 450 steps through dense jungle, river crossings, and a climb back up. It takes around 1.5–2 hours round trip. A reasonable fitness level is recommended. Our certified local guide walks at your pace throughout.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">What should I wear for the Sekumpul waterfall tour? <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></button>
                    <div class="faq-answer"><p>Wear closed-toe shoes with good grip — sandals or flip flops are not suitable as the trail can be slippery. Quick-dry clothes or a swimsuit underneath are recommended as you will likely get wet near the falls. Bring a dry bag for your phone and valuables.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">Is the Sekumpul trek suitable for children? <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></button>
                    <div class="faq-answer"><p>Children aged 8 and above with reasonable fitness can complete the trek with supervision. The steps are steep in places, and our guide will assist children on the more challenging sections. Please assess your child's fitness level before booking.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">Can we swim at Sekumpul Waterfall? <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></button>
                    <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes! Swimming in the natural rock pools at the base of Sekumpul Waterfall is one of the highlights of the tour. The water is cold, fresh, and incredibly refreshing after the jungle trek. Bring your swimsuit!</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">What is included in the Sekumpul tour price? <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></button>
                    <div class="faq-answer"><p>All-inclusive: private A/C transport from your Bali hotel, an English-speaking driver, a specialized local trekking guide at Sekumpul village, all waterfall entrance fees, a traditional Indonesian lunch, bottled mineral water, plus all parking and toll fees.</p></div>
                </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <aside>
                <div class="pricing-card">
                    <h3 style="color:var(--primary-color);font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:10px;">Package Pricing</h3>
                    <p style="color:#666;font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:20px;">All-Inclusive Private Tour</p>
